v 3
d surveye: SurvEye interactive HTML dashboards from Survey Solutions and SurveyCTO surveys
d
d SurvEye creates a polished interactive dashboard from a Survey Solutions
d questionnaire preview (HTML) or a SurveyCTO form definition (XML) or
d printable form (HTML), together with the corresponding data in memory.
d Supports
d questionnaire and custom variables, smart variable families, subgroup comparisons,
d flexible sections, filters, highlights, discrete-count detection,
d native Stata weights, runtime weight/USD switches, profile tables,
d an editorial default finish with configurable background, typography,
d corners, shadows, motion, and page width, optional confidence intervals,
d live-filtered numeric summaries,
d Arabic/Urdu right-to-left interfaces, Unicode, and optional Leaflet GPS maps
d with Google or OpenStreetMap base layers.
d
d Version: 2.3.2
d Requires: Stata 16 or newer
d Author: Attique Ur Rehman
d Affiliation: Enterprise Analysis Unit, World Bank
d Repository: https://github.com/arehman10/SurvEye
d Support: https://github.com/arehman10/SurvEye/issues
d Distribution-Date: 20260905
d License: MIT
d
f surveye.ado
f surveye.sthlp
F surveye.jar
F surveye_2_3_2.jar
f example.do
f README.md
f REVIEW_NOTES.md
f QA_REPORT.md
f LICENSE
f THIRDPARTY-LICENSES.md
f CHANGELOG.md
e
